blem", "score": 1}, {"id": "B", "text": "We monitor suppliers from time to time where there have been problems in the past", "score": 2}, {"id": "C", "text": "We routinely monitor  high-risk suppliers", "score": 3}, {"id": "D", "text": "We routinely monitor all suppliers", "score": 4}, {"id": "E", "text": "We routinely engage with all suppliers on their supply chain  performance including all aspect of ESG", "score": 5}]}, {"id": "Q9", "type": "core", "category": "Stakeholder Engagement", "question": "The following best describes our plan for stakeholder engagement related to  due diligence and performance in our supply chain", "options": [{"id": "A", "text": "We don’t have a plan", "score": 1}, {"id": "B", "text": "We have started to develop a plan", "score": 2}, {"id": "C", "text": "We have a plan in place that includes critical international external stakeholders", "score": 3}, {"id": "D", "text": "We have a plan in place that includes international and local/community external stakeholders", "score": 4}, {"id": "E", "text": "We have a plan in place that includes  external stakeholders and is routinely updated as part of a continual improvement process", "score": 5}]}, {"id": "Q10", "type": "core", "category": "Reporting and Disclosure", "question": "The following best describes how we report on our human rights supply chain due diligence program and its results", "options": [{"id": "A", "text": "We do not publicly report", "score": 1}, {"id": "B", "text": "We report against some elements of established due diligence reporting standards", "score": 2}, {"id": "C", "text": "We report on only material topics using one established ESG reporting standards", "score": 3}, {"id": "D", "text": "We report on only material topics using multiple established ESG reporting standards", "score": 4}, {"id": "E", "text": "We report on only material topics using multiple established ESG reporting standards with full supply chain transparence and performance", "score": 5}]}, {"id": 